koans"}," have three fuel-rich moons in their home system.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The crew cabins of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Hardcell"]},"-Class Interstellar Transport (located in the uppermost portion of the ship's nose cone) are designed for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skakoan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skakoan","referenceId":"reference:957e71a1633337a7"}," habitation. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skakoans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skakoans"}," can forego their pressure suits in the crew cabins, but other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," require either ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flight Suits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flight_Suits"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Suits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Suits"}," to survive.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although heavily armored, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Hardcell"]},"-Class Transport is only lightly armed, and vulnerable to well-placed shots. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," against a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Hardcell"]},"-Class Transport deals triple damage, rather than double damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Hardcell"]},"-Class Interstellar Transport Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +15\n"]},"\n",{"